### =========================================================================
### DIFAMAP WEBGIS BACKEND API TEST COLLECTION (VSCode REST Client)
### =========================================================================
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api

### 1. Health Check Service
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Mengambil Semua Lokasi (Places & Sidewalks) dengan Skor AI
GET {{baseUrl}}/locations

### 3. Filter Lokasi Khusus Kursi Roda (Tunadaksa) dengan Skor Minimal 4.0
GET {{baseUrl}}/locations?wheelchairOnly=true&minScore=4.0

### 4. Filter Lokasi Khusus Tunanetra (Guiding Block Baik)
GET {{baseUrl}}/locations?visuallyImpairedOnly=true

### 5. Filter Khusus Ruas Trotoar / Jalan Pedestrian
GET {{baseUrl}}/locations?entityType=SIDEWALK

### 6. Detail Satu Lokasi (Misal: MaRI)
GET {{baseUrl}}/locations/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### 7. Mengambil Feed Aktivitas Komunitas
GET {{baseUrl}}/activities

### 8. Membuat Postingan Aktivitas Baru (Demo Payload)
POST {{baseUrl}}/activities
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "a0eebc99-9c0b-4ef8-bb6d-6bb9bd380a11",
  "title": "Mampir lihat Danau UNHAS",
  "description": "Jalur lingkar danau sangat tenang dan datar, permukaan paving rata untuk kursi roda manual.",
  "mediaUrls": [
    "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1501785888041-af3ef285b470?w=800"
  ],
  "specificLocation": "Danau UNHAS Tamalanrea",
  "latitude": -5.13842,
  "longitude": 119.49214,
  "status": "PUBLIC",
  "accessibilityTags": ["Danau", "Kursi Roda", "Asri"]
}

### 9. Chatbot Asisten Aksesibilitas DifaMap (Spatial RAG Makassar)
POST {{baseUrl}}/chatbot/message
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Apakah Pantai Losari ramah untuk pengguna kursi roda di sore hari?",
  "userLocation": {
    "latitude": -5.14766,
    "longitude": 119.40632
  }
}

### 10. MAPID Geoserver Open API - Ambil Daftar Layer Proyek
GET {{baseUrl}}/mapid/project/layers

### 11. MAP Analysis Tool - Isokron Catchment (5, 10, 15 Menit Kursi Roda dari Halte Karebosi)
GET {{baseUrl}}/mapid/analysis/isochrone?lat=-5.13421&lng=119.40932&intervals=5,10,15&mode=wheelchair

### 12. MAP Analysis Tool - Slope & Elevation Profile (Uji Tanjakan Trotoar)
POST {{baseUrl}}/mapid/analysis/elevation-slope
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "coordinates": [
    [119.4058, -5.1412],
    [119.4063, -5.1476],
    [119.4165, -5.1583]
  ]
}

### 13. MAPID SINI AI - Multi-Criteria Priority Grid Heatmap Makassar
GET {{baseUrl}}/mapid/analysis/sini-grid?gridSize=1000
